# 实操篇：一步步写进项目

## 第 1 步：建用户表

```sql
CREATE TABLE `blog_user` (
  `id` BIGINT NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '用户 ID',
  `username` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL COMMENT '用户名',
  `password` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL COMMENT '密码（BCrypt 加密存储）',
  `nickname` VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT NULL COMMENT '昵称',
  `email` VARCHAR(100) DEFAULT NULL COMMENT '邮箱',
  `phone` VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT NULL COMMENT '手机号（数据脱敏时用）',
  `avatar` VARCHAR(500) DEFAULT NULL COMMENT '头像 URL',
  `status` TINYINT DEFAULT '1' COMMENT '状态 0-禁用 1-启用',
  `create_time` DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',
  `update_time` DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',
  `deleted` TINYINT DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '逻辑删除 0-未删除 1-已删除',
  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),
  UNIQUE KEY `uk_username` (`username`) COMMENT '用户名唯一索引',
  UNIQUE KEY `uk_email` (`email`) COMMENT '邮箱唯一索引'
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci COMMENT='用户表';
```

> 放在 Flyway `V1__create_blog_tables.sql`（建表归 V1），管理员账号放 V2 种子数据。不要手动敲 SQL。

## 第 2 步：加依赖

```xml
<!-- JWT 签发与校验 -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.jsonwebtoken</groupId>
    <artifactId>jjwt-api</artifactId>
    <version>0.12.6</version>
</dependency>
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.jsonwebtoken</groupId>
    <artifactId>jjwt-impl</artifactId>
    <version>0.12.6</version>
    <scope>runtime</scope>
</dependency>
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.jsonwebtoken</groupId>
    <artifactId>jjwt-jackson</artifactId>
    <version>0.12.6</version>
    <scope>runtime</scope>
</dependency>
<!-- 只引入密码加密，不引入整个 Spring Security -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.security</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-security-crypto</artifactId>
    <version>6.3.4</version>
</dependency>
```

## 第 3 步：配置

`application.yml`：

```yaml
jwt:
  access-secret: ${JWT_ACCESS_SECRET:blog-access-secret-change-me-in-production-2026}
  refresh-secret: ${JWT_REFRESH_SECRET:blog-refresh-secret-change-me-in-production-2026}
  access-expire-minutes: 30
  refresh-expire-days: 7
  login-lock:
    max-fail-attempts: 5
    lock-minutes: 10
```

> 生产用环境变量注入密钥，别用默认值。双密钥分离：access/refresh 用不同密钥，刷新令牌泄露也伪造不出访问令牌。

## 第 4 步：Java 文件逐个讲

### ① `util/JwtUtil.java` — 双令牌签发中心

```java
// 签发访问令牌（30分钟，用 access 密钥）
Jwts.builder().subject(userId).claim("username", uname).claim("type", "access")
    .issuedAt(now).expiration(expiry).signWith(accessKey).compact();

// 签发刷新令牌（7天，用 refresh 密钥）
Jwts.builder().subject(userId).claim("username", uname).claim("type", "refresh")
    .issuedAt(now).expiration(expiry).signWith(refreshKey).compact();
```

### ② `service/TokenService.java` — Redis 会话管理

```java
// 登出：删 access + 回收刷新令牌
tokenService.removeAccessToken(token);
tokenService.revokeUserRefreshTokens(userId);

// 禁用/改密：一键踢下线全部会话
tokenService.killUserSessions(userId);   // 删 auth:user:{id} + 刷新令牌集合

// 防爆破：计数 + 锁定
tokenService.incrementFailCount(username, lockMinutes);  // INCR + EXPIRE
tokenService.lockUser(username, lockMinutes);             // SET auth:lock:{user} 10分钟
```

### ③ `util/UserContext.java` — ThreadLocal 存 userId

```java
private static final ThreadLocal<Long> USER_ID = new ThreadLocal<>();
// 请求结束必须 clear()（afterCompletion 里做），防线程复用串号
```

### ④ `service/impl/AuthServiceImpl.java` — 登录核心

```java
// 注册：BCrypt 加密 + 自动分配 user 角色
public Long register(RegisterDTO registerDTO, HttpServletRequest request) {
    user.setPassword(passwordEncoder.encode(registerDTO.getPassword()));
    userMapper.insert(user);
    userRoleMapper.assignRole(user.getId(), "user");
    saveAuditLog(user.getId(), username, "REGISTER", request, "注册成功");
    return user.getId();
}

// 登录：防爆破 → BCrypt 比对 → 双令牌签发
public Map<String, Object> login(LoginDTO loginDTO, HttpServletRequest request) {
    checkLocked(username);                          // 查 Redis 锁
    if (!passwordEncoder.matches(pwd, user.getPassword())) {
        recordLoginFailure(username, request, "密码错误");   // INCR + EXPIRE
        throw new BlogException(400, "用户名或密码错误");
    }
    String accessToken = jwtUtil.generateAccessToken(user.getId(), user.getUsername());
    String refreshToken = jwtUtil.generateRefreshToken(user.getId(), user.getUsername());
    tokenService.saveAccessToken(accessToken, user.getId(), accessExpireMinutes);
    tokenService.saveRefreshToken(refreshToken, user.getId(), refreshExpireDays);
    saveAuditLog(user.getId(), username, "LOGIN_SUCCESS", request, "登录成功");
    return Map.of("accessToken", accessToken, "refreshToken", refreshToken, ...);
}

// 刷新：校验 refresh → 签发新令牌 → 轮换旧 refresh
public Map<String, Object> refresh(String refreshToken, HttpServletRequest request) {
    Claims claims = jwtUtil.parseRefreshToken(refreshToken);
    if (!tokenService.validateRefreshToken(refreshToken, userId)) throw 401;
    if (!tokenService.isUserActive(userId)) throw 401;    // 查闸门
    tokenService.rotateRefreshToken(oldToken, newToken, userId, ttlDays);
    return Map.of("accessToken", newAccess, "refreshToken", newRefresh, ...);
}

// 改密：更新密码 → 踢下线全部会话 → 写审计
public void changePassword(ChangePasswordDTO dto, Long userId, HttpServletRequest request) {
    user.setPassword(passwordEncoder.encode(dto.getNewPassword()));
    userMapper.updateById(user);
    tokenService.killUserSessions(userId);
    saveAuditLog(userId, username, "CHANGE_PASSWORD", request, "修改密码成功");
}
```

### ⑤ `entity/LoginLog.java` + `LoginLogMapper.java` — 审计日志

```java
@Data
@TableName("blog_login_log")
public class LoginLog implements Serializable {
    @TableId(value = "id", type = IdType.AUTO)
    private Long id;
    private Long userId;          // 登录失败时可能为空
    private String username;
    private String operation;     // REGISTER/LOGIN_SUCCESS/LOGIN_FAIL/LOGOUT/REFRESH/CHANGE_PASSWORD
    private String ipAddress;
    private String detail;
    private LocalDateTime createTime;
}

// 查询审计记录
SELECT operation, username, ip_address, detail, create_time FROM blog_login_log;
```

### ⑥ `config/JwtInterceptor.java` — 三层校验

```java
public boolean preHandle(...) {
    // 1. OPTIONS 放行
    // 2. 取 Authorization 头，没有 → 401
    // 3. JWT 验签 → 失败 → 401
    // 4. 查 auth:access:{token} → 不存在 → 401
    // 5. 查 auth:user:{id} → 不存在 → 401
    // 6. UserContext.setUserId() → 放行
}
```

### ⑦ `config/WebConfig.java` — 拦截器注册 + CORS 收口

```java
registry.addInterceptor(jwtInterceptor)
        .addPathPatterns("/**")
        .excludePathPatterns("/auth/register", "/auth/login", "/auth/refresh",
                              "/articles/page", "/articles/hot", "/articles/{id}",
                              "/comments/article/**", "/category/**", "/tag/**", "/error");
config.setAllowedOrigins(origins);  // 从配置读，生产禁止 *
```

## 第 5 步：端到端验证

**登录**（拿双令牌）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"123456"}'
# 预期：code:200 + accessToken + refreshToken
```

**拦截器**（不带 token）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/articles -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}'
# 预期：code:401 "未登录，请先登录"
```

**刷新**（access 过期后换新）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"refreshToken":"<refreshToken>"}'
# 预期：返回新的 accessToken + refreshToken
```

**登出**（旧令牌立即失效）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout -H "Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>"
# 之后再用旧 token 调接口 → 401 "登录已失效，请重新登录"
```

**防暴力破解**（连错 5 次后）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"admin","password":"错密码"}'
# 第 6 次 → code:429 "尝试次数过多，账号已锁定"
```

**改密**（所有会话踢下线）：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/auth/password \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" -H "Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>" \
  -d '{"oldPassword":"123456","newPassword":"NewPass123","confirmPassword":"NewPass123"}'
# 改完旧 token → 401
```

## 第 6 步：接口防刷限流

**问题**：只有登录有防爆破，其他接口（评论、点赞）没有限流——攻击者可以刷接口消耗资源。

**方案**：`@RateLimit` 注解 + AOP 切面 + Redis 计数（与防爆破同一原理）。

**注解**：

```java
@Target(ElementType.METHOD)
@Retention(RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME)
public @interface RateLimit {
    String key();                     // 限流 Key（区分接口）
    int count() default 10;           // 窗口内最大请求数
    long time() default 1;            // 窗口大小
    TimeUnit timeUnit() default TimeUnit.MINUTES;
    boolean byUser() default true;    // 按 userId 还是 IP
}
```

**AOP 切面核心逻辑**：

```java
@Around("@annotation(rateLimit)")
public Object around(ProceedingJoinPoint joinPoint, RateLimit rateLimit) throws Throwable {
    String identity = byUser ? "u:" + UserContext.getUserId() : "ip:" + clientIp;
    String key = "rate:" + rateLimit.key() + ":" + identity;

    long count = redisUtil.increment(key);                    // INCR
    redisUtil.expire(key, ttlSeconds, TimeUnit.SECONDS);      // EXPIRE

    if (count > rateLimit.count()) {
        throw new BlogException(429, "请求过于频繁，请稍后重试");
    }
    return joinPoint.proceed();
}
```

**用法**：在 Controller 方法上加注解即可：

```java
@PostMapping
@RequiresPermission("comment:create")
@RateLimit(key = "comment:create", count = 10, time = 1)    // 每用户每分钟最多10条评论
public Result<Long> addComment(...) { ... }

@PostMapping("/{id}/like")
@RateLimit(key = "like", count = 20, time = 1)              // 每用户每分钟最多20次点赞
public Result<Void> likeComment(...) { ... }
```

## 第 7 步：日志脱敏

**问题**：审计日志里 `log.info("登录成功: phone=13800138000")`——手机号明文写进了日志文件，运维/DBA 都能看到。

**方案**：Logback 自定义转换器 `SensitiveDataConverter`，在日志输出时自动清理敏感信息。

**Logback 配置**（`logback-spring.xml`）：

```xml
<conversionRule conversionWord="dmsg"
                converterClass="com.blog.log.SensitiveDataConverter"/>
<encoder>
    <pattern>%d{yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss} [%thread] %-5level %logger{36} - %dmsg%n</pattern>
    <!--                     用 %dmsg 替代 %msg ↑                        -->
</encoder>
```

**转换器核心逻辑**：

```java
public class SensitiveDataConverter extends MessageConverter {
    // 手机号：13800138000 → 138****8000
    private static final Pattern PHONE = Pattern.compile("(1[3-9]\\d)\\d{4}(\\d{4})");
    // 邮箱：zhangsan@gmail.com → z***@gmail.com
    private static final Pattern EMAIL = Pattern.compile("(\\w)[\\w.]*@(\\w+\\.\\w+)");
    // 密码字段：password=123456 → password= ******
    private static final Pattern PASSWORD = Pattern.compile(
            "(password|token|secret)\\s*[:=]\\s*[\"']?([^\"'\\s,}]+)[\"']?",
            Pattern.CASE_INSENSITIVE);

    public static String desensitize(String msg) {
        msg = PHONE.matcher(msg).replaceAll("$1****$2");
        msg = EMAIL.matcher(msg).replaceAll("$1***@$2");
        msg = PASSWORD.matcher(msg).replaceAll("$1: ******");
        return msg;
    }
}
```

**效果**：

```
脱敏前：登录成功 phone=13800138000 email=zhangsan@gmail.com
脱敏后：登录成功 phone=138****8000  email=z***@gmail.com
```

